# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dated working directories (past fix / investigation / deploy work)
# Pattern catches any top-level dir carrying a YYYY-MM-DD or YYYYMMDD stamp,
# so future working dirs are ignored by default too.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*-2026-10-*
*-2026-11-*
*-2026-12-*
*-2027-*
*-202610*
*-202611*
*-202612*
*-2027*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Loose top-level clutter (evidence, drafts, probes, one-off scripts)
# Tracked top-level files (README.md, HEARTBEAT.md, etc.) are already in the
# index, so these patterns do not untrack them — they only hide new clutter.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*-2026-*.md
*-202610*.md
*-202611*.md
*draft*.md
*probe*.py
*probe*.log
merge-live-test.sh
ops_state_snapshot.py
task-interruption-evidence.md
reply-*.txt
login-qr.png
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.mp4
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.mp3
*.wav

